<title>THAILAND: Thai Airways Q1 net profit rises.</title>
<headline>Thai Airways Q1 net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited financial results for Thai Airways for first quarter ending 31 December, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>					For First Quarter</p>
<p>					1996	   1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		    1.07	   0.91</p>
<p>    Net			    1,500	  1,277</p>
<p>NOTES: Company's full name is Thai Airways International Plc.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
</text>
